# See bootstash(5) and /usr/share/doc/bootstash/QUICKSTART.md
# Add only overrides. Commented values match /usr/lib/bootstash/default-dist
# or are unset (derived at runtime). OIDC: bootstash provision-google
# (installs the downloaded Google client JSON as
# /etc/bootstash/oidc-google.json, not this file).
#
# DATA=/var/lib/bootstash
# PAM_SERVICE=bootstashd
# BIND=127.0.0.1:8080
# MAX_UPLOAD=33554432
# SHARED_WRITABLE=0
# UNIX_GROUP=bootstash
#
# Not in default-dist (derived unless set):
# PUBLIC_ORIGIN=
# CERT_NAME=
# TLS_CERT=
# TLS_KEY=
# ADMIN_USERS=
